<title>SPAIN: Folgado says Spain to meet '97 deficit/GDP target.</title>
<headline>Folgado says Spain to meet '97 deficit/GDP target.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Budget Secretary Jose Folgado said on Monday he was convinced Spain would meet its target of reducing the budget deficit to gross domestic product to three percent in 1997 from 4.4 percent last year.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm totally convinced of making it,&quot; Folgado told Reuters in an interview.</p>
<p>--Sharman Esarey, Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
